      "writtenOn": "2022-09-19T20:16:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s because the DSA algorithm is not yet supported[1]. This one only checks the apk_digest extracted from apk is expected while the others also verify the whole apk (check signed data, computing digest etc). I tried to enable DSA, but it crashes in openssl with the current implementation, so this test only checks the apk_digest extracted is valid. The test above checks the error in verification. Otherwise, do you know if there\u0027s any spec about validating DSA for Android?\n\n[1] https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:packages/modules/Virtualization/libs/apkverify/src/algorithms.rs;l\u003d108",
      "parentUuid": "a572a968_1f21e0a1",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 54,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 55,
        "endChar": 27
      },
      "revId": "7186b26318ec58d72f61a38342ff5306f3cbdf5b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7973aa99_4f244040",
        "filename": "libs/apkverify/tests/apkverify_test.rs",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 55,
      "author": {
        "id": 1042276
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-09-19T21:07:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "TL;DR Let\u0027s just add a comment. I don\u0027t think we strictly need to support DSA.\n\nAndroid actually selects the \"best\" algorithm it thinks, and the \"best\" can change between dessert releases.  The platform as a verifier can choose whatever it prefers, unless none of the signatures in the APK are supported, which is unlikely.  Assuming the APK won\u0027t contain only DSA signature, we can just pick other ones.\n\nPS. It looks like the current Android implementation[1] doesn\u0027t really have a preference between signature algorithms (but only maps to the underlying digest algorithm).\n\n[1] http://cs/android-internal/frameworks/base/core/java/android/util/apk/ApkSignatureSchemeV3Verifier.java;l\u003d314;rcl\u003d04c5e8611f47532c59469e0f1f635d3cbcfd57b6",
      "parentUuid": "237ebd48_9f2787ae",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 54,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 55,
        "endChar": 27
      },
